# Gate `check-llvm` (and CI) on the YSX auto-td guard suite, so the
# "no hand-written instruction TableGen" promise, the manifest round-trip, the
# coverage invariant, and the CMake-integration contract are enforced rather than
# only checked by a manual `python -m unittest`.
#
# This directory's lit.local.cfg marks the suite unsupported unless the YSX
# target is registered, so no explicit REQUIRES line is needed here.
#
# RUN: %ysx-run-auto-td-guards
